WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Vhidhiyo iyi inotsanangura mashandisirwo eArclight kuita fandal red reflex nekusarudza mwenje unopenya zvakanyanya.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Ita shuwa kuti lens rack iri kumusoro, uko pasina lens simba mugomba rekuona.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Kureba kweruoko, tarisa reflex mumaziso ese panguva imwe chete.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Enzanisa kupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Mukuongorora kwakajairika, hapafanirwe kuve nemusiyano wakazara mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Muvana vachena neAsia, reflex inogona kutaridzika yakawanda orenji uye yero.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Zvitarisiko izvi zvichiri zvakajairika sezvo ruvara rwese uye kupenya kwakafanana pakati pemaziso maviri.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
An abnormal reflex kana paine kuramba kuchienderera, musiyano chaiwo mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Iyi inogona kunge iri displaced corneal reflection, chigamba chakasviba chiripo mukati me reflex yerimwe ziso kana maziso ese, kana kusavapo zvachose dzvuku reflex.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Abnormal reflex test inogona kuratidza kuvepo kwecataract, retinoblastoma, corneal scar, squint, kana refractive kukanganisa.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Izvi zvese zvinoda kumwe kuongororwa nenyanzvi.
